This file is the compiled WebAssembly module of the `tree-sitter-twig`
grammar published as `tree-sitter-twig@0.8.2` on npm. It is vendored here
rather than installed from npm because the upstream package's `install`
script (`node-gyp rebuild`) fails on every machine — the tarball does
not ship the `binding.gyp` that node-gyp would need, so the build fails
regardless of whether a C/C++ toolchain is present. We only need the
prebuilt `.wasm`, so vendoring it directly is the correct fix.

Source: https://github.com/kaermorchen/tree-sitter-twig
License: MPL-2.0
